   188	### 2.1 Element mapping (proposal; OS0 measures it, OS1 fixes it)
   189	
   190	| GND metaschema | Ossie ontology | Disposition |
   191	|---|---|---|
   192	| object type `kind: entity` | `concept`, `type: EntityType` | native |
   193	| object type `kind: value`, `primitive` | `type: ValueType`, `extends: [<built-in>]` | native; `Duration` has no built-in, so it is kept as a GND value type: `extends: [Integer]`, with its meaning in the extension (o, OD5, a deliberate divergence) |
   194	| `subtype_of` | `extends` | native |
   195	| subtype derivation rule | concept `derived_by` | requires/extension (OS2) |
   196	| `reference` (preferred identifier) | `identify_by` and an identifying relationship | native |
   197	| `independent`, `storage`, `description`, `provenance` | `description`; the rest in the extension | native + extension |
