   202	| spanning, external uniqueness; mandatory; frequency; ring; subset; equality; exclusion; exclusive-or; value range; value comparison; cardinality; subtype partition; guarded | `requires` formulas where the grammar can state them | requires, else extension |
   203	| alethic/deontic `modality`, `source`, `status`, `rationale`, `remedy` | none | extension |
   204	| derivation rules and aggregates | `derived_by`; `COUNT[...]`-style aggregates | requires/extension (OS2) |
